WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.900
Choose the campus and service lines.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:10.500
Set the growth target, turnover, effective dates, in-house increase range,
Street Rate limits, competitive position, and equalization strength.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Modulo solves low, target, and high occupancy scenarios
and marks the measured tier.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.200
Interpret quarterly variance, turnover, growth, and revenue.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:29.000
Then share a one-page executive PDF with recommendations,
impact, resident distribution, and projected rates.